(6156170, 908294, 120893, '<td valign="top">I love the interplay of light and shadows.  The triangles are there, but sublime.  It causes you to look twice (or more) to see through the many layers.</td>', 'I love the interplay of light and shadows.  The triangles are there, but sublime.  It causes you to look twice (or more) to see through the many layers.', '2010-09-08 10:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
