(6156187, 908145, 120893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I could only imagine what you could do were you free to do more editing within the challenge guidelines.  Great balance, flow to it.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I could only imagine what you could do were you free to do more editing within the challenge guidelines.  Great balance, flow to it.', '2010-09-08 11:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6156193, 908278, 120893, '<td valign="top">It''s either too busy for me, or too gray- not the contrast of real black and white (which I know is way hard to achieve).</td>', 'It''s either too busy for me, or too gray- not the contrast of real black and white (which I know is way hard to achieve).', '2010-09-08 11:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6156204, 908277, 120893, '<td valign="top">I like that this captures a moment that many (most) people can relate to in probably specific circumstances.  I also like the minimalism.</td>', 'I like that this captures a moment that many (most) people can relate to in probably specific circumstances.  I also like the minimalism.', '2010-09-08 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6156209, 908277, 118396, '<td valign="top">Cool capture, but you might get higher scores if you weren''t giving everyone the finger!  :)  Just kidding!</td>', 'Cool capture, but you might get higher scores if you weren''t giving everyone the finger!  :)  Just kidding!', '2010-09-08 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6156211, 908287, 120893, '<td valign="top">This is one ''animal-face'' photo where the triangles are not overwhelmed by the animal itself.  In other words, you can tell it''s about the triangle, not the critter.  Good job and a good model too!</td>', 'This is one ''animal-face'' photo where the triangles are not overwhelmed by the animal itself.  In other words, you can tell it''s about the triangle, not the critter.  Good job and a good model too!', '2010-09-08 11:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6156219, 908293, 120893, '<td valign="top">This photo really doesn''t jump off the page when I browsing the general lay out, so I do not know if you will get a lot of votes because I don''t know if a lot of people will relate to the smaller image and take time to look closely, but I hope they do.  It was your title that made open a full-view and I am glad I did (so good job there).  Maybe not the best photo technically either (from my perspective).  However, there are a lot of elements I like: subject matter, the up close view of the die, the positioning of the die and the bag.  I gotta rate it up there!</td>', 'This photo really doesn''t jump off the page when I browsing the general lay out, so I do not know if you will get a lot of votes because I don''t know if a lot of people will relate to the smaller image and take time to look closely, but I hope they do.  It was your title that made open a full-view and I am glad I did (so good job there).  Maybe not the best photo technically either (from my perspective).  However, there are a lot of elements I like: subject matter, the up close view of the die, the positioning of the die and the bag.  I gotta rate it up there!', '2010-09-08 11:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
