(6158941, 908226, 61396, '<td valign="top">I was browsing innocently among triangles of sorts, and then this came by, so you can understand the shock. On top of the luck in getting the shot, I admire you for submitting it, and for the presentation.</td>', 'I was browsing innocently among triangles of sorts, and then this came by, so you can understand the shock. On top of the luck in getting the shot, I admire you for submitting it, and for the presentation.', '2010-09-11 06:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
