(6161637, 908214, 105457, '<td valign="top">Fits perfectly the challenge description, but voters tend to low vote the entries that look homemade, unless they are very good. If I could suggest to improve this shot, you could give it a better angle and a not so tight crop, like this it just looks that you''ve missed the framing.</td>', 'Fits perfectly the challenge description, but voters tend to low vote the entries that look homemade, unless they are very good. If I could suggest to improve this shot, you could give it a better angle and a not so tight crop, like this it just looks that you''ve missed the framing.', '2010-09-14 12:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161640, 907440, 105457, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t quite spot the triangles, all I see is a ladybug, and it''s not a bug known by its triangular form :) Nice bokeh and colours, but it doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'I couldn''t quite spot the triangles, all I see is a ladybug, and it''s not a bug known by its triangular form :) Nice bokeh and colours, but it doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2010-09-14 12:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161646, 908167, 105457, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it''s out of focus. It could be greatly improved by focusing correctly and also by increasing the blacks, so you wouldn''t see the right hand side.</td>', 'Good idea, but it''s out of focus. It could be greatly improved by focusing correctly and also by increasing the blacks, so you wouldn''t see the right hand side.', '2010-09-14 12:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161647, 907377, 105457, '<td valign="top">I like the colour difference very much in this photo. The reflection does a good job at strengthening the composition, but the fence in the foreground makes the picture look like it''s not been planned, but just snapshot. The ambiance is very good though.</td>', 'I like the colour difference very much in this photo. The reflection does a good job at strengthening the composition, but the fence in the foreground makes the picture look like it''s not been planned, but just snapshot. The ambiance is very good though.', '2010-09-14 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161649, 908117, 105457, '<td valign="top">It''s very triangular :) But in this kind of composition, it should be centered, and at the moment it is not, and also it''s a bit crooked. You should crop it square, and pay attention to the lines, we can see that they are not straight. Also, a boost in contrast and brightness would improve it a lot.</td>', 'It''s very triangular :) But in this kind of composition, it should be centered, and at the moment it is not, and also it''s a bit crooked. You should crop it square, and pay attention to the lines, we can see that they are not straight. Also, a boost in contrast and brightness would improve it a lot.', '2010-09-14 12:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6161651, 907437, 105457, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit too much like a snapshot, taken from the road or a car. As for processing, it could be somewhat improved by a black and white image with great contrast, it would be more interesting.</td>', 'This looks a bit too much like a snapshot, taken from the road or a car. As for processing, it could be somewhat improved by a black and white image with great contrast, it would be more interesting.', '2010-09-14 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
