(6162401, 908292, 100727, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites.  Not much bokeh but still it is a great image.  The colour popped out really great.</td>', 'This is one of my favourites.  Not much bokeh but still it is a great image.  The colour popped out really great.', '2010-09-15 02:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
