(6162624, 908307, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well seen triangle and enjoyable use of color. I think this at the very least deserved comments during the challenge (I missed voting/commenting this challenge). The scaffolding (?) across the top has high contrast that keeps pulling my attention. When I scroll that part out of the image (like a crop, even though there are lots of triangles there), the remaining elements feel much more dramatic and unified.</td>', 'Well seen triangle and enjoyable use of color. I think this at the very least deserved comments during the challenge (I missed voting/commenting this challenge). The scaffolding (?) across the top has high contrast that keeps pulling my attention. When I scroll that part out of the image (like a crop, even though there are lots of triangles there), the remaining elements feel much more dramatic and unified.', '2010-09-15 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6162640, 908072, 19035, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2010-09-15 09:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6162641, 908288, 119063, '<td valign="top">Actually, I PM''d Bear_Music who was quite helpfull.  It would appear that he is more willing to provide constructive help than "others" are.  Thank you Bear_Music for positively contributing to why I believe we''re all here.  On a side note, hats off to anyone who shoots objects mooving in flight and get clear shots.  I sifted through hundreds of shots from the show just to find 1 good one and learned alot along the way.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-15 09:45:19.</i></td>', 'Actually, I PM''d Bear_Music who was quite helpfull.  It would appear that he is more willing to provide constructive help than "others" are.  Thank you Bear_Music for positively contributing to why I believe we''re all here.  On a side note, hats off to anyone who shoots objects mooving in flight and get clear shots.  I sifted through hundreds of shots from the show just to find 1 good one and learned alot along the way.', '2010-09-15 09:28:25.000000', '2010-09-15 10:45:19.000000', 0),
(6162645, 907814, 98339, '<td valign="top">Good Job Barry!!!  I didn''t even see the challenge as I was out of town...</td>', 'Good Job Barry!!!  I didn''t even see the challenge as I was out of town...', '2010-09-15 09:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
