(6162687, 908066, 23435, '<td valign="top">Very well done. This structure is in Montreal, Canada on the Expo ''67 site. It used to be all white but burned may years ago to leave only the structure.</td>', 'Very well done. This structure is in Montreal, Canada on the Expo ''67 site. It used to be all white but burned may years ago to leave only the structure.', '2010-09-15 10:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
