(6168007, 908009, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh see, now you''re in trouble.  Because a) <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> likes your work (and he likes really odd stuff), b) because you caught <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>''s attention, and b) ''cause I like your work and half the time I don''t know what I''m doing.  Welcome to DPC!</td>', 'Oh see, now you''re in trouble.  Because a)  ubique likes your work (and he likes really odd stuff), b) because you caught  Yo_Spiff''s attention, and b) ''cause I like your work and half the time I don''t know what I''m doing.  Welcome to DPC!', '2010-09-21 12:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
