(6270074, 908209, 83313, '<td valign="top">Feedback, per your request:<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting shot and a bit different, but does not come off with a strong visual impact for me. The major issue for me is that I think the pipe cleaners that are creating the framing structure are also serving to distract my eye from those great bubbles. Visually, the bubbles are a secondary subject. Even though they hold more interest, they do not grab the eye first.</td>', 'Feedback, per your request: It''s an interesting shot and a bit different, but does not come off with a strong visual impact for me. The major issue for me is that I think the pipe cleaners that are creating the framing structure are also serving to distract my eye from those great bubbles. Visually, the bubbles are a secondary subject. Even though they hold more interest, they do not grab the eye first.', '2011-01-04 10:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
